  unitName: Rider Empress Vermilion
  unitId: 10776
  unitNumber: 1178
  description: Research conducted in Grand Gaia during recent years has uncovered
    more information regarding this legendary empress. According to a story written
    on ancient parchment, Vermilion found herself mostly on the defensive during
    her battle against the demon which had attacked her troops. Nonetheless, being
    a talented and instinctive warrior, the empress was able to outmaneuver the demon
    and awaken her true power during the struggle. It is written that after this
    took place, Vermilion was finally able to face her opponent on the same level,
    making for a fair fight. However, this account differs greatly from her supposed
    glorious victory previously recorded in Agni's history.
  summonDesc: No defeats shall tarnish my name.<br>My actions are justice.<br>My
    words are fact.
  fusionDesc: You are adorable.<br>Come closer.<br>There is no need for restraint.
  evoDesc: Ahh... Another adrenaline rush...<br>But I can still fight...<br>This
    battle shall never end...
  element: 1
  rarity: 6
